# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Azure AD Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
#
# How to get these values:
#   1. Go to https://portal.azure.com
#   2. Navigate to: Azure Active Directory → App registrations → New registration
#   3. App Registration settings:
#        - Name: Systech Marketplace (or any name)
#        - Supported account types: Accounts in this organisational directory only (Single tenant)
#        - Redirect URI Platform: Web  ← IMPORTANT: Select "Web", NOT "Single-page application"
#        - Redirect URI: http://localhost:3000  (add your production URL too)
#   4. After registration:
#        - Copy the Application (client) ID  → VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID
#        - Copy the Directory (tenant) ID    → VITE_AZURE_TENANT_ID
#   5. Under Authentication:
#        - Ensure "Web" platform is configured (not SPA)
#        - Add redirect URIs for all environments
#        - Front-channel logout URL: (optional) your app's /logout route
#        - Leave implicit grant checkboxes UNCHECKED (using auth code flow)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID=2ecd5bf2-32ec-4289-965c-71277149697b
VITE_AZURE_TENANT_ID=17dcec91-66ec-4c4b-a988-473694df546c
